# Привет or здравствуйте?
subtitle: "Привет or здравствуйте, ты or вы: how to greet a friend and a stranger in Russian, and how to say goodbye to each."
thumb: "band \"Don't say привет to her\" stamp \"ТЫ or ВЫ?\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}

## Привет or здравствуйте?
level: basic

    icon tom size 170 set twemoji x 130 y 470 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 130 y 335 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon masha size 170 set twemoji x 870 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 870 y 330 font_size 32 hidden true
    group speakers members ["tom","tom_name","masha","masha_name"] hidden true
    text tag_street "In the street" #8f887c x 500 y 625 font_size 32 hidden true
    text tag_shop "In a shop" #8f887c x 500 y 625 font_size 32 hidden true
    group tags members ["tag_street","tag_shop"] walk replace hidden true
    shape counter #8f6a4c shape rect x 870 y 378 width 230 height 40 style.fill #d9b48f hidden true
